ine": "Cubin II is a first-person puzzle-platformer game that is the sequel to Cubin.\nYou are immersed once again in the LGA experience, but this time on the other side of things, at the moment when everything changed after your victory. You quickly discover a new way to escape from this hell. During the 50 new experiments to solve, you will once again be accompanied by Alice, and you will have to team up to move forward together.\n\nIn this alternate world, each experiment becomes more difficult, and the mechanics are more advanced.\nDiscover new ways to propel yourself, move through the darkness, wield the cube, and even think and explore. Think carefully and surpass yourself during these final trials, but be careful, because no missteps will be tolerated...", "summary": "Cubin II is a first-person puzzle-platformer game that re-immerses you in the LGA experience. Complete the story by solving these 50 new experiments to finally escape from this terrible place.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cubin-ii", "videos": [{"id": 162525, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "OOg-TboXpYA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOg-TboXpYA", "title": "Cubin II - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OOg-TboXpYA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}